On Sun, Dec 14, 2008 at 12:38:03PM -0600, joebaldwin@agilethinker.com wrote:
> 	Other then feeling real dumb. I would like to get a replace mean with
> out reinstalling the system. 

Well the format is generally this:

deb http://ftp.<countrycode>.debian.org/debian <release> main [contrib] [non-free]

So for example:

deb http://ftp.ca.debian.org/debian lenny main contrib non-free

or

deb http://ftp.us.debian.org/debian lenny main

-- 
Len Sorensen



